"You have an important exam tomorrow.","Estudio hasta las tantas.":"I study until late at night.","Repaso lo justo: confío en mí.":"I review just enough: I trust myself.","Me agobio muchísimo.":"I get really stressed.","¿Examen? Ya veré mañana.":"Exam? I'll see tomorrow.","Alguien se burla de ti delante de todos.":"Someone mocks you in front of everyone.","Le contesto en el acto.":"I answer back on the spot.","Le devuelvo una broma mejor.":"I hit back with a better joke.","Le ignoro por completo.":"I ignore them completely.","Me afecta, aunque no lo diga.":"It hurts, even if I don't say it.","¿Qué es lo más importante para ti?":"What matters most to you?","Ser el mejor.":"Being the best.","La amistad.":"Friendship.","La libertad.":"Freedom.","La calma.":"Calm.","El camino se divide: uno oscuro y corto, otro largo y soleado.":"The path splits: one dark and short, the other long and sunny.","El oscuro, ¡más emoción!":"The dark one, more excitement!","El largo, sin prisa.":"The long one, no rush.","Me siento a pensarlo un rato.":"I sit down to think it over.","Ninguno: abro un atajo nuevo.":"Neither: I make a new shortcut.","¿Qué dicen de ti tus amigos?":"What do your friends say about you?","Que siempre pueden contar conmigo.":"That they can always count on me.","Que soy lo más divertido del grupo.":"That I'm the funniest one in the group.","Que soy un poco misterioso.":"That I'm a bit mysterious.","Que no me rindo nunca.":"That I never give up.","Tu día libre ideal es…":"Your ideal day off is…","Entrenar para ser mejor.":"Training to get better.","Quedar con todos mis amigos.":"Hanging out with all my friends.","Una aventura sin ningún plan.":"An adventure with no plan at all.","Leer, pensar, estar tranquilo.":"Reading, thinking, being calm.","No te lo piensas dos veces cuando alguien necesita ayuda.":"You don't think twice when someone needs help.","Tus amigos saben que pueden contar contigo siempre.":"Your friends know they can always count on you.","Mides cada paso antes de darlo.":"You measure every step before taking it.","Contagias energía allá donde vas.":"You spread energy wherever you go.","Mantienes la calma cuando todo se complica.":"You keep calm when things get complicated.","Actúas primero y piensas después. ¡A veces sale bien!":"You act first and think later. Sometimes it works!","Te exiges ser el mejor, y casi siempre lo consigues.":"You push yourself to be the best, and you almost always are.","Siempre tienes una broma preparada.":"You always have a joke ready.","Vas a tu aire y no te importa.":"You do your own thing and don't care.","Te cuesta dar el primer paso, pero sientes mucho.":"It's hard for you to take the first step, but you feel deeply.","Nada te altera. Nada.":"Nothing fazes you. Nothing.","Sabes esperar el momento justo.":"You know how to wait for the right moment.","Ni tú sabes qué vas a hacer después.":"Not even you know what you'll do next.","Rendirse no entra en tus planes.":"Giving up isn't in your plans.","Ves soluciones donde otros ven problemas.":"You see solutions where others see problems.","Tu amabilidad tranquiliza a todos los que te rodean.":"Your kindness calms everyone around you.",Jugar:"Play","Entra en la mazmorra":"Enter the dungeon",Pokémon:"Pokémon","Tu colección":"Your collection",Mejoras:"Upgrades","Haz más fuerte cada run":"Make every run stronger","9 regiones · Pokémon y shinies":"9 regions · Pokémon and shinies",Misiones:"Missions","Misiones, logros y perfil":"Missions, achievements and profile",Amigos:"Friends","Juega en grupo, hasta 4":"Play in a group, up to 4",Ranking:"Leaderboard","Quién aguanta más":"Who survives longest",Ajustes:"Settings","Sonido, gráficos, controles y cuenta":"Sound, graphics, controls and account","{x} premio por recoger":"{x} reward to claim","{x} premios por recoger":"{x} rewards to claim","premio por recoger":"reward to claim","premios por recoger":"rewards to claim","Volver a tu sala ({x})":"Back to your room ({x})","{x} en línea":"{x} online"